Sediakan kamar untukku di sana.

428
00:28:40,596 --> 00:28:43,515
Tepat di sebelahmu, keparat.

429
00:28:43,599 --> 00:28:44,558
Stack, dengar…

430
00:28:47,853 --> 00:28:48,812
