437
00:29:06,997 --> 00:29:09,666
<i>Takkan ada yang bisa hentikan aku.</i>

438
00:29:10,959 --> 00:29:13,128
<i>Takkan dihentikan.</i>

439
00:29:13,962 --> 00:29:15,047
<i>Takkan dihentikan…</i>

440
00:29:15,130 --> 00:29:17,466
