443
00:29:25,307 --> 00:29:26,558
Kau kenal mereka?

444
00:29:29,645 --> 00:29:30,604
Semuanya.

445
00:29:32,606 --> 00:29:33,482
Apa yang terjadi?

446
00:29:39,238 --> 00:29:40,822
Aku dan Rice, temanku,

447
00:29:42,533 --> 00:29:44,576
